{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792310581,"nonce":"uQHceU9o050s5++iB6bKJgYvQec=","title":"FIXED 2026-09-05 — the MIR devirtualizer turned a CallIndirect through a `fn_ref` closure into a CallDirect with the caller's args only, ...","message":"**Landed:** commits 72b574b4 (devirt env) af61b4fb (map slot adapters) edd52081 (KeyValueIterator protocol) a7c1041c (erased Null\u003cT\u003e boundaries) 721e10d0 (typer IMap identity); battery 439/439 vs conf_d9c, GAINED Issue3635 / LOST Issue12700 both bistable on one binary (12700: 2/5 PASS).\n\n**Shape:** `try_interface_dispatch` emits `call_indirect slot(obj, args…)`; the backend\nloads `{fn_ptr, env}` from the closure struct and calls `fn_ptr(env, obj, args…)`. Every\n`__vtable_dispatch_thunk__*` (real or map adapter) is `(env, this, args…)`.\n`compiler/src/ir/devirtualize.rs` Phase 2 replaced the indirect call with\n`CallDirect(thunk, [obj, args…])` — no env — so `this` ← obj? NO: `env` ← obj, `this` ← key,\n`a0` ← the next live value (a `rayzor_update_call_frame_location` const: `i32 42`).\nProof: pre-opt LLVM IR `call haxe_stringmap_exists(ptr %key, inttoptr (i32 42))`.\n\n**Why it hid:** the origin analysis only resolves a slot when the `fn_ref` store is visible in\nthe same function, i.e. after inlining `new KV(sm)`/`hasLit(sm)` into the function that built\nthe fat pointer. `viaIface(im:IMap)` (fat pointer as a PARAM) never devirtualizes ⇒ worked.\n\n**Fix:** prepend `IrValue::Null` env when the callee declares `args.len()+1` params; equal\narity stays direct; anything else stays indirect. `param_counts` from\n`module.functions[f].signature.parameters.len()`.\n\n**How to apply:** an interface probe must include BOTH shapes: the receiver as a parameter\n(never devirtualized) and the receiver built in the same function (devirtualized). `mi_q`\n(`hasLit(sm)` / `hasParam(sm,k)`) is the regression probe. Related: [[bugs-imap-never-loads-generic-subtype-import]],\n[[project-imap-extern-map-slot-adapters-plan]].\n\n---\nArchived from Claude memory `bugs_devirtualizer_dropped_closure_env` on 2026-10-18. A record of past work; open items in it may have their own issues.","files":null}]}